    ":question/id": "e52f80d1-431d-51a0-9c51-950dc1a91065",
    ":question/math-academy-id": "e-138",
    ":question/problem": "Find the derivative of $f(x) = 6x^3$.",
    ":question/worked-solution": "We apply the constant multiple and power rules, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf^{\u2032}(x) &= \\frac{d}{dx}(6x^{3}) \\\\\n&= 6 \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(x^{3}) \\\\\n&= 6 \\cdot 3x^{2} \\\\\n&= 18x^{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
